  "note": "Verso body page, one full column (verso text measure x 0.314-0.903); the whole body is the continuation of the 'Example 1.10' box, which runs the full depth y 0.1345-0.9371. The box is emitted once as role box with n: null - A2 split its contents into 15 blocks and none of them IS the box, so guessing an n would be wrong; its fill is the flat grey #dbdcde interior, flanked by solid cyan #00adef vertical bars (left x 0.262-0.304 carrying the reverse-out white vertical label 'EXAMPLE 1.10', right x 0.888-0.901). Those bars and the vertical label get no separate element because no allowed role fits a box side-tab. All 15 A2 blocks sit inside the box and so have bboxes within it; blocks typed 'box' by A2 are the box's running prose and are reported as role paragraph, which is what they are on the page. Box prose is set one notch smaller than body prose (cap height 18px vs 20px), hence size_rel 0.9 throughout. page_header_band is the pale blue #c6eafb strip across the whole page top (y 0-0.067); its #41c7f4 hairline and #00adef foot rule are internal edges of that band, not separate bars - no rule_bar and no footer_rule on this page. The '2022-23' edition line at the foot is recorded as a second running_header because the allowed role list has no footer-text role. All 15 A2 blocks matched by position."
